   "threadId": "pb18_004",
   "internalDate": 1770933600000,
   "bodyText": "Phase 1 is complete. Approval landed for the expanded budget at $410K after savings from spot instances. Kafka, Flink, TimescaleDB, dbt, and Great Expectations are running.",
